ely. This confirms a consistent, albeit complex, reordering.\n\n**Reordering Output Columns**\n\nI've confirmed the output column order for pattern rows is derived from sorting input columns by the count of [6,6] pairs, yielding the sequence c3, c4, c1, c0, c2. This allows reconstruction of odd rows, completing the pattern analysis.\n\n",
